msgid "Latency cap (ms)"
msgstr "延迟上限 (ms)"

msgid "Discard candidate IPs whose average latency is above this threshold (measured via the node's local SOCKS)."
msgstr "丢弃平均延迟高于此阈值的候选 IP（经节点本地 SOCKS 测得）。"

msgid "Latency lower bound (ms)"
msgstr "延迟下限 (ms)"

msgid "Discard candidate IPs whose average latency is below this threshold."
msgstr "丢弃平均延迟低于此阈值的候选 IP。"

msgid "Packet loss rate cap"
msgstr "丢包率上限"

msgid "Discard candidate IPs whose packet loss ratio exceeds this value (0–1)."
msgstr "丢弃丢包率超过此值（0–1）的候选 IP。"

msgid "IP list source"
msgstr "IP 列表来源"

msgid "Select the built-in Cloudflare IP list, an online CM source, or a custom file used as candidates"
msgstr "选择内置 Cloudflare IP 列表、在线 CM 源或自定义文件作为候选"

msgid "Online CM source"
msgstr "在线 CM 源"

msgid "Online source URL"
msgstr "在线源 URL"

msgid "Source list in <code>IP:PORT#country</code> format. Shared by all 5 CM IP lists below; each list keeps only its own port."
msgstr "源列表格式为 <code>IP:端口#国家</code>；下方 5 个 CM IP 列表共用此源，各自只保留自己配置的端口。"

msgid "Country filter"
msgstr "国家过滤"

msgid "Only keep IPs tagged with the selected countries. Leave none selected to keep every country on this port."
msgstr "只保留标了所选国家的 IP；不勾选任何国家则该端口下所有国家都保留。"

msgid "Port"
msgstr "端口"

msgid "Keep only source entries on this port (Cloudflare serves 443 / 8443 / 2053 / 2083 / 2087 / 2096). Default 443."
msgstr "只保留源里该端口的条目（Cloudflare 常见 443 / 8443 / 2053 / 2083 / 2087 / 2096），默认 443。"

msgid "Define up to 5 CM-source IP lists. All share the online URL above; each filters by its own country set and port. Assign one list per passwall worker node in the Third-Party tab. Workers without an explicit list use the first enabled list. Only used when IP list source = Online CM source. Note: the port only picks the candidates — the port actually probed is the worker node's own port, so set the node to the same port."
msgstr "最多定义 5 个 CM 源 IP 列表，共用上面的在线源 URL，各自按自己的国家集合与端口筛选。在「第三方设置」里给每个 passwall worker 节点指派一个列表；未指派的节点回退到第一个启用的列表。仅在「IP 列表来源 = 在线 CM 源」时生效。注意：这里的端口只用于挑候选 IP，真正探测用的端口是 worker 节点自身的 port，请把节点端口设为同一个。"

