msgstr "独立操作台的监听端口。默认 17544，避开 LuCI 端口和 Lucky 常用的 17543。"

msgid "Listen address"
msgstr "监听地址"

msgid "0.0.0.0 listens on all interfaces (LAN access; WAN is still blocked by the firewall). Use a specific LAN address if needed."
msgstr "0.0.0.0 表示监听所有接口（局域网可访问，WAN 仍由防火墙拦截）。需要时也可以填写具体的局域网地址。"

msgid "Console username"
msgstr "操作台用户名"

msgid "The password is set on the console's first-run page and can be changed from the console settings; it is stored as a salted SHA-256 hash in UCI."
msgstr "密码在操作台首次打开时设置，之后可在操作台设置中修改；UCI 中只保存加盐 SHA-256 哈希。"

msgid "Open console"
msgstr "打开操作台"

msgid "The console listens on its own port. On first use it asks you to create the admin password. For remote access use a VPN or a TLS reverse proxy; do not expose the plain HTTP port to the internet."
msgstr "操作台使用独立端口；首次打开会要求创建管理员密码。远程访问请走 VPN 或带 TLS 的反向代理，不要把明文 HTTP 端口直接暴露到公网。"

msgid "Console"
msgstr "操作台"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Open web console"
msgstr "打开 Web 操作台"

msgid "Web console"
msgstr "Web 操作台"

msgid "The standalone console is the main operations UI: overview, nodes, IP lists, settings, logs and third-party integrations. This LuCI page only shows its status and opens it."
msgstr "独立操作台是主要管理界面：概览、节点、IP 列表、设置、日志和第三方集成。本 LuCI 页面只显示运行状态并提供打开入口。"

msgid "The console has its own login. On first open it asks you to create the admin password."
msgstr "操作台有独立登录；首次打开会要求创建管理员密码。"

msgid "Enable it in Settings → Web Console and save."
msgstr "请在「设置 → Web 操作台」中启用并保存。"

msgid "Full configuration stays available in "
msgstr "完整配置仍可在 "

msgid "."
msgstr "。"

msgid "Operations Console"
msgstr "操作台"

msgid "The standalone console is the main operations and configuration UI: overview, nodes, IP lists, settings, logs and third-party integrations. This LuCI page only shows its status and opens it."
msgstr "独立操作台是主要的管理和配置界面：概览、节点、IP 列表、设置、日志和第三方集成。本 LuCI 页面只显示运行状态并提供打开入口。"

msgid "Enable it in Settings and save."
msgstr "请在「设置」中启用并保存。"

msgid "Console service settings (enable, port, username, password reset) are in "
msgstr "操作台入口设置（启用、端口、用户名、重置密码）在 "

msgid "This page only configures the standalone web console entry. All speed-test settings and operations are in the console."
msgstr "本页只配置独立 Web 操作台入口；所有测速设置和操作都在操作台里。"

msgid "Starts the separate console on its own port with its own admin login."
msgstr "在独立端口启动操作台，使用单独的管理员登录。"

msgid "The password is created on the console's first-run page and changed from the console settings."
msgstr "密码在操作台首次打开时创建，之后可在操作台设置中修改。"

msgid "Session timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "会话有效期（秒）"

msgid "How long a console login stays valid. Default 3600 seconds."
msgstr "操作台登录保持有效的时长，默认 3600 秒。"

msgid "Opens the standalone console in a new tab."
msgstr "在新标签页打开独立操作台。"

msgid "Reset console password"
msgstr "重置操作台密码"

msgid "Forgets the console admin password and invalidates existing console sessions. The next console visit asks you to create a new password."
msgstr "清除操作台管理员密码并使现有会话失效；下次打开操作台会要求重新创建密码。"

msgid "Reset the console password? The next console visit will ask for a new one."
msgstr "重置操作台密码？下次打开操作台会要求创建新密码。"

msgid "Console password reset. Open the console to create a new one."
msgstr "操作台密码已重置，请打开操作台创建新密码。"
msgid "Online update"
msgstr "在线更新"

msgid "Downloads the latest GitHub release and installs it. Refused while a speed test is running."
msgstr "下载并安装 GitHub 最新 Release；测速运行中拒绝更新。"

msgid "Update status"
msgstr "更新状态"

msgid "Ready to update."
msgstr "可以更新。"

msgid "Updating…"
msgstr "更新中…"

msgid "A speed test is running; stop it before updating."
msgstr "测速正在运行，请先停止再更新。"

msgid "Target version"
msgstr "目标版本"

msgid "Refresh page"
msgstr "刷新页面"

msgid "Download and install the latest GitHub release? The page may reload after the update."
msgstr "下载并安装 GitHub 最新 Release？更新后页面可能需要刷新。"

msgid "Update refused"
msgstr "更新被拒绝"

msgid "Update started."
msgstr "已开始更新。"

msgid "Starting…"
msgstr "启动中…"

msgid "Update finished. Refresh the page to use the new version."
msgstr "更新完成，刷新页面以使用新版本。"

msgid "Current version"
msgstr "当前版本"

msgid "Latest version"
msgstr "远端版本"

msgid "Update available"
msgstr "有可用更新"

msgid "Already up to date"
msgstr "已是最新版本"

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "检查更新"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "检查中…"

msgid "Check failed"
msgstr "检查更新失败"

msgid "Check the latest GitHub release; the update button is enabled only when a newer version is available."
msgstr "检查 GitHub 最新 Release；只有存在新版本时「在线更新」才可用。"

msgid "Not checked yet."
msgstr "尚未检查"

msgid "Update finished"
msgstr "更新完成"

msgid "Refresh the page to use the new version."
msgstr "刷新页面以使用新版本。"

msgid "Update failed"
msgstr "更新失败"
